  "title": "Elaine&#39;s Sweet and Tangy Loose Beef BBQ",
  "description": "This slow cooker recipe makes a wonderful and tangy loose BBQ for sandwiches that is very easy to make and takes little hands-on time. Serve over toasted buns.",
